      value: -50
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8902907873516035281, guid: 8696efd15abc1d7468b2986604dc05f1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: '"Select all unique combinations of three rune stones to activate the
        mechanism!"'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 9091669035569178768, guid: 8696efd15abc1d7468b2986604dc05f1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Text
      value: "That\u2019s Correct!\n\nThe rune stones were A, B, C, and D. Since
        we are selecting 3 runes and the order does not matter, each selection counts
        as a single result. This is called a combination.\n\nLet\u2019s list all
        possible groups of 3 runes:\n\nABC, ABD, ACD, BCD\n\nThere are 4 total combinations.\n\nThis
        can be denoted by the following notations:\n\nnCr C(n, r) C(\\nfrac{n}{r})\r\n\nn
        = there are a total of 4 runes\n\nr = there are 3 selected at a time\n\nC(\\nfrac{4}{3})
        C(4, 3) _4C_3\n\nThe four rune stones have 4 unique combinations when selecting
        3 runes."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
